      "About 4 dollars a serving at the brand price we saw",
      "Contains cane sugar and ashwagandha, which not everyone wants daily",
      "Dozens of superfoods share a few grams of blend space"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "Best when you want a filling, high-protein breakfast shake and accept that the superfoods are mostly a garnish.",
