    "pros": [
      "7 g of fiber in 150 calories, per the label",
      "Organic fruit and vegetable blend plus probiotics",
      "Sold in a 28-serving tub that brings the per-serving cost down"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "150 calories is a snack unless you blend in fruit, oats or nut butter",
